# Agent Runtime only needs the Python agent source and the root build files.
# Keep generated datasets, frontend dependencies, evaluation artifacts, and
# infrastructure definitions out of the Docker build upload.
*
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.search-service
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.pyc
src/**/.adk/
